{"symbol":"RS1.L","area":"europe","updated":"2026-11-09T20:21:03Z","info":{"address1":"Fifth Floor","address2":"Two Pancras Square","city":"London","zip":"N1C 4AG","country":"United Kingdom","phone":"44 20 7239 8400","website":"https://www.rsgroup.com","industry":"Industrial Distribution","industryKey":"industrial-distribution","industryDisp":"Industrial Distribution","sector":"Industrials","sectorKey":"industrials","sectorDisp":"Industrials","longBusinessSummary":"RS Group plc, together with its subsidiaries, engages in the distribution of maintenance, repair, and operations products and service solutions in the United Kingdom, the United States, France, Mexico, Germany, Italy, Switzerland, and internationally. The company offers automation and control, and electrification products; cables and connectors; mechanical and fluid power products, such as transmission, pneumatics, and hydraulic components; semiconductors and passive components; test and measurements products; personal protective equipment (PPE), workwear, and janitorial products; and facilities and maintenance products for buildings. It also provides bundling, kitting, labelling, and assembly services; digital procurement platforms that enhance productivity, reduce spend, and streamline supplier management; inventory solutions that optimize inventory management to reduce waste, enhance supply chains, and lower costs; and DesignSpark, a software tool for design engineers. In addition, the company offers design, manufacturing, and prototyping; maintenance engineering and safety; and integrated supply chain and procurement solutions. The company provides its customers with product and service solutions for designing, building, maintaining, repairing, and operating industrial equipment. It serves design and discrete manufacturing, process manufacturing, facilities and intralogistics, and energy and utilities industries. The company was formerly known as Electrocomponents plc. RS Group plc was founded in 1937 and is headquartered in London, the United Kingdom.","fullTimeEmployees":8500,"companyOfficers":[{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Simon Charles Conrad Pryce","age":64,"title":"CEO & Executive Director","yearBorn":1961,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":1603900,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Katherine Beresford Ringrose","age":51,"title":"CFO & Executive Director","yearBorn":1974,"fiscalYear":2026,"totalPay":1008949,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Janet  Robertson","title":"Chief Information Officer","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Lynn  Webster-Scott","title":"Head of Corporate Public Relations","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Jane  Titchener","title":"Head of Corporate Development","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Steve  Izquierdo","title":"Chief People Officer","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Sean  Fredericks","title":"President of Asia Pacific - RS","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Mr. Pete  Malpas","title":"President of EMEA - RS","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Ellen  Li","title":"Chief Financial Officer of Asia Pacific RS Components","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0},{"maxAge":1,"name":"Ms. Elaine  Pointon","title":"Chief Finance Officer of EMEA RS Components","fiscalYear":2026,"exercisedValue":0,"unexercisedValue":0}],"auditRisk":3,"boardRisk":1,"compensationRisk":9,"shareHolderRightsRisk":1,"overallRisk":5,"governanceEpochDate":1793491200,"compensationAsOfEpochDate":1798675200,"executiveTeam":[],"maxAge":86400,"priceHint":2,"previousClose":789.5,"open":790.5,"dayLow":777.5,"dayHigh":802,"regularMarketPreviousClose":789.5,"regularMarketOpen":790.5,"regularMarketDayLow":777.5,"regularMarketDay